WEBVTT

00:22:57.125 --> 00:23:00.228
and more security and more upside.

00:23:00.252 --> 00:23:02.109
And if they did bad things,

00:23:02.133 --> 00:23:05.824
it would be punitive
and cause them to have fewer chances.

00:23:06.221 --> 00:23:09.633
If it were a transparent and fair system,

00:23:09.657 --> 00:23:16.123
I think people here in China
would not have a lot of objections.

00:23:16.147 --> 00:23:19.512
But of course, the presumption
may not be believed

00:23:19.536 --> 00:23:21.416
by people in other countries.

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.814
CA: It's such a big issue.

00:23:22.838 --> 00:23:25.048
Because if you put together
what's being built

00:23:25.072 --> 00:23:26.659
with possibilities of the future,

00:23:26.683 --> 00:23:28.712
like facial recognition,

00:23:28.736 --> 00:23:32.914
you could imagine a government
that maybe started out benign,